# Git Commit Messages

Follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) in **English**, aligned with [clowder-ai](https://github.com/zts212653/clowder-ai) style.

## Format

```text
<type>(<scope>): <short summary>

[optional body]
```

## Message rules

- Subject in English; imperative mood (`add`, not `added` / `Adding`)
- **Subject ≤ 72 characters** (aim ~50); one line only
- Types: `feat` | `fix` | `docs` | `perf` | `refactor` | `test` | `chore` | `ci`
- Scope = package or domain: `core` | `api` | `mcp` | `web` | `harness` | `openspec`
- Body is **optional**. If present: 1–3 short sentences on **why / impact**, not a file checklist
- Do **not** list every touched path, UI detail, or OpenSpec folder in the body
- Pass the message via HEREDOC; no Chinese in the subject
- Only commit when the user asks

## Split granularity (default: finer)

**Unit of commit = one OpenSpec change, or one coherent user-facing story.**
Never dump the whole working tree into one “ship everything” commit.

| Split when | Keep together when |
|---|---|
| Different OpenSpec folders / why | One feature’s vertical slice (`core`+`api`+`web`+tests for **that** story) |
| Feature vs incidental UI polish | Pure package-boundary split of the same refactor (e.g. not one commit per `db.ops` submodule) |
| Code vs docs-only archive (optional) | Tiny docs sync that only exists to land the same feature |
| Unrelated bugfix riding along | — |

Prefer **2–5 focused commits** over one mega-commit when the working tree mixes stories.
Do **not** over-split into one commit per file or per package **inside** a single story.

When the user says「提交」and the tree has multiple stories: **split first**, then push.
Ask only if the split boundaries are unclear.

## Good

```text
feat(api): share examine finalize via Critic+gate
feat(web): show daily owed/plan brief with one-tap 开考
feat(web): switch sticky companion via composer @
docs(openspec): archive daily-verify-loop and composer-at-mention
```

```text
feat(web): add daily workspace sidebar

Learners need plan/queue and notes in one place for same-day review.
```

## Bad

```text
feat: ship daily verify loop and composer @mention
feat: ship companion-os bridges, chat polish, and archive specs
feat: ship mastery graph, digest prefs, and Apple plan bridge
```

(Mega-ship. Several OpenSpec / product stories in one commit — **split**.)

```text
feat(core): add daily plan, notes, chat persistence and web workspace

- gotit.db: SQLAlchemy async models ...
- api.routes: /v1/days ...
- web: Apple-style ...
```

(Changelog subject + body file dump.)

```text
refactor(core): split db.ops into day module
refactor(core): split db.ops into note module
refactor(core): split db.ops into claim module
```

(Over-split of one cohesive refactor by submodule.)
